  data: {
    LLM: "Decision 1: Only 'Let It Ride' if you have: A winning hand already (10s or better), 3 cards to a Royal Flush, or 3 cards to a Straight Flush with no gaps (or one gap with at least one high card).\n\nDecision 2 Strategy: Let it ride if you have 4 cards to a Flush, a 4-card open-ended Straight, any winning hand already, or 4 cards to a Straight Flush.\n\nThe 'Straight Flush' Exception: In Decision 1, let it ride on 3 cards to a Straight Flush ONLY if the cards are in sequence (e.g., 3-4-5) and have at least one high card, or if they have spreads like 3-4-6. Avoid letting it ride on 3-card inside straight flush draws.",
    Player: "Decision 1: Only 'Let It Ride' if you have: A winning hand already (10s or better), 3 cards to a Royal Flush, or 3 cards to a Straight Flush with no gaps (or one gap with at least one high card).\n\nDecision 2 Strategy: Let it ride if you have 4 cards to a Flush, a 4-card open-ended Straight, any winning hand already, or 4 cards to a Straight Flush.\n\nThe 'Straight Flush' Exception: In Decision 1, let it ride on 3 cards to a Straight Flush ONLY if the cards are in sequence (e.g., 3-4-5) and have at least one high card, or if they have spreads like 3-4-6. Avoid letting it ride on 3-card inside straight flush draws.",
